    "description": "As a Bonus Action, you heal a friendly unit other than yourself. This spell is more powerful the closer your target is to death. \n\nA target above 50% HP will heal only 1d6 HP and 1 Stn.\nA target below 50% HP will heal 2d6 + Cha HP and 3 Stn.\nA target below 25% HP will heal 4d6 + Cha HP and 5 Stn.&nbsp;<div><br></div><div style=\"\">&nbsp;Gain an additional use of this spell at A-Rank Divine Proficiency.</div>",
